&lt;h4 id="a10-link-aggregation"&gt;A10 Link Aggregation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h5 id="8023ad-lacp"&gt;802.3ad LACP&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A10 trunk can config a maximnm of 16 LACP trunks per device.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#abb2bf;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;interface ethernet 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; lacp trunk 1 mode active
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; lacp timeout long
